Type: Package
Package: main
Title: Embedded R MAIN_MODULE Front-End for WebAssembly
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Isabel", "Paredes", , "isabel.paredes@quantstack.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Thin Emscripten MAIN_MODULE executable that embeds R via
    Rf_initEmbeddedR and exposes C entry points for initializing a session and
    evaluating R code from JavaScript. Intended for browser/WASM hosts such as
    Lucent; not a CRAN package.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
SystemRequirements: emscripten
Biarch: false
NeedsCompilation: yes
